---
description: Never add Cursor co-author trailers to git commits
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git commits

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any Cursor/agent co-author trailer to commits.
- Commit messages should only contain the user's intended message text.
- If a trailer is auto-appended, strip it before finishing (amend only when safe per commit rules; otherwise fix on the next commit without re-adding it).
